/*
 * Root dispatcher for list-comprehension validation.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - detecting the underlying iterable type(array, slice, map, tuple, range, class),
 *   - enforcing aliasing and reference rules,
 *   - enforcing copy-mode when required by the iterable type,
 *   - delegating validation to the appropriate submodule,
 *   - constructing result allocation declarations for list comprehensions,
 *   - computing compile-time lengths for static allocations.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::slicefor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/slicefor.yr
